Priests are fast and can cast paralysation.  You definitely want to 
take them out from a distance.  Further, the patron deity, if inside 
a tempel, will often interfere (i.e., burn you to a crisp).  A good 
tactic, if you really need to convert it, is to take the priest out 
from outside the temple (you may dig out the walls first).  Don't 
use lightning, they are shock-resistant.  Sleep works wonders, though.  

